// "Aldmere" — the standard campaign: a continent about three times the size of
// the Reach. The nine realms of the Reach return with larger holdings and are
// joined by five new ones. Province attributes, adjacency, rivers and straits
// are generated by `npm run genworld` (tools/genworld.ts) from the authored
// geography in tools/aldmere.spec.ts into aldmere.provinces.json; the browser
// loads the drawn geometry (aldmere.map.json) on demand.

